            "answer": "<p>We dispatch every order the same working day or the next working day, once it has been received or confirmed with you. Our jars, bottles and containers are kitchen and food-storage products, so for hygiene reasons we cannot accept returns. If an item arrives damaged or something goes wrong in transit, we will exchange it. Just contact us within 7 days of delivery.</p>"
